    automated_test "rust/tests/unit/ci-cd/issue_1021.rs"
    manual 'measured 2026-08-19: the eleven `ci_cd::issue_1021` tests pass locally in 3.8s; mutation-verified three times -- signalling only the root of the tree leaves the stalled child alive, restoring `timeout "$attempt_seconds"` fails the guard at `scripts/apt-install-with-retry.sh:90`, and reading elapsed time from bash\x27s `SECONDS` alone fails the accuracy test with `a 3s deadline expired after 2.480484781s`. Measured accuracy (`experiments/issue-1021-deadline-precision/measure.sh`): 3.5s on a 3s deadline, 10.8s on a 10s one, never early. Confirmed on macOS 2026-08-19: all eleven tests pass on the macOS core slices of run 32294252392, including slices 15/16 and 16/16, the two that reported `timeout: command not found` in run 32282461075 (`docs/case-studies/issue-1021/logs/macos-deadline-tests-green.log`); the lower-bound test measured 3.835s against its 3s deadline there. See findings 16, 17 and 18'
